@version 1

/// Bounded direct-package translation of packedLen from
/// packages-ts/galerina-ext-tritsocket/src/prefilter.ts.
///
/// The TypeScript shadow accepts a JavaScript Number and applies
/// Math.floor((lenTrits + 3) / 4). This leaf uses Int for the intended
/// nonnegative integer trit-count domain, where integer division is exact
/// parity. Fractional, nonfinite, negative, and out-of-i32 source Numbers
/// remain host/manual input-marshalling boundaries.
///
/// This computes a byte count only. Trit encoding, byte-array identity,
/// socket transport, and the deny-only admission gate remain host boundaries;
/// Maybe never becomes an Allow through this leaf.

pure flow packedLen(lenTrits: Int) -> Int
contract { intent { "Return the number of packed bytes required for a nonnegative integer trit count." } }
{
  return (lenTrits + 3) / 4
}
